        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"201785\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://dub1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/21f3000759/48/23528_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"quote-title__text-content\">\n      <a href=\"https://discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/t/mega-thread-oppe-faqs-and-pyqs/201785/2\">Mega Thread - OPPE FAQs and PYQs</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/courses/sc-kb/36\"><span data-category-id=\"36\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #0088CC; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"9\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square --has-parent\" title=\"This category is created to address subject-specific queries related to System Commands\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">System Commands</span></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Exam Pattern - \n\nTA sessions with resources - <a href=\"http://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1liIvOdufraJQrWgIgogAxBJ_VDOEz_nB-S_PSjRFdkM/edit?gid=0#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1liIvOdufraJQrWgIgogAxBJ_VDOEz_nB-S_PSjRFdkM/edit?gid=0#gid=0</a> \nQuestions from previous term \n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/hashkrish/se2001-notes/tree/main/question_papers\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">se2001-notes/question_papers at main · hashkrish/se2001-notes · GitHub</a>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pfEgobqTZrasX7HNbjPFstRfKDbXAcTN?usp=drive_link\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">System Commands - OPPE questions - Google Drive</a>  - Shared by Anupam\n<a href=\"https://github.com/23f1002382/OPPE1_SystemCommands_Jan2024\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - 23f1002382/OPPE1_SystemCommands_Jan2024: OPPE_1 Questions and my Answers... · GitHub</a>\n\nExtra Questions \n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/SwatiJainCoder/SC_OPPE_Qs\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - SwatiJainCoder/SC_OPPE_Qs: This is a repository for practice OPPE qu…</a>\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Its already shared in the pinned post at the top.</p>",
